        "description": "Yamano Mitsuha is a Japanese High-schooler that fell off a cliff and was subsequently transported to another world, gaining a special ability in her new world.\n\nMitsuha is an intelligent person. She uses her intelligence to solve her and others' problems, with answers and solutions unbefitting of her age, to others' surprise, as they still think Mitsuha is very young with Mitsuha's short stature. Not only is she a great actress. She is also very cunning, as she avoids tough situations by twisting others' words to fit her situation.",
